    "body": "Closes #41775\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\n\r\nServers cannot request refreshing stale LSP folding ranges after a project-wide change.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nAdvertise `workspace.foldingRange.refreshSupport` and re-request folding ranges for active buffers when handling `workspace/foldingRange/refresh`.",
